[format["So you'd like to become a police officer, %1?,<br/><br/><t color='#FF0000'>MaxSec</t> are a group of like-minded people who wish to serve the citizens of %2. If you'd like to do your part in bringing peace and justice to this small nation, you're already on your way.<br/><br/>You must be at least 17 years of age and have 12 or more talent points on the LoonyBin servers as a civilian. If you meet these criteria, read on.<br/><br/>Applications for whitelisted police access are submitted on our forums. After being accepted you'll be interviewed on Teamspeak and then begin your first week as a cadet. Cadets always ride along with constables, which is the next rank you can achieve after proving your ability.<br/><br/>Being whitelisted does not put you in a police slot at the lobby -- there are no police slots. Everyone joins as a civilian. Once you are cleared, report to the duty terminal inside <t color='#FF0000'>MaxSec</t> Emergency Response HQ to clock on for a shift, and clock off at the same terminal when it ends.<br/><br/>Police are one of the most important roles on LoonyBin servers. You'll protect the citizens in many ways, while stopping rebels in actions such as bank and federal reserve robberies, prison breaks, and so much more.<br/><br/>Police have access to special equipment from rubber bullets to remote controlled aerial reconnaissance drones.<br/><br/>If you meet the above criteria and would like to join MaxSec, apply now on our forums at <t color='#4444FF'>our Discord</t>. Visit the Police Applications forum.", profileName, worldName], "policeRecruit"] spawn AP_fnc_handleMessage;